      "message": "If I do that we\u0027re back to square one, where I have to validate the raw pointers coming in and return errors before I can possibly convert them to Rust types, aren\u0027t we? I\u0027ve refactored the code again to avoid code duplication instead (get and put are identical up to a point).",
